  "id": "diagnostic-center",
  "term": "diagnostic center",
  "definition": "A diagnostic center is a specialized hospital or clinic unit where people are assessed with diagnostic tests for a particular health concern. In this source, it refers to a prenatal service that performs procedures such as amniocentesis and chromosome testing and provides related genetic counseling to guide reproductive decisions.",
